Available Infrastructure Providers:

Provider: AWS
  API Version: infrastructure.cluster.x-k8s.io/v1beta2
  Description: Amazon Web Services infrastructure provider

Provider: Azure
  API Version: infrastructure.cluster.x-k8s.io/v1beta1
  Description: Microsoft Azure infrastructure provider

Provider: GCP
  API Version: infrastructure.cluster.x-k8s.io/v1beta1
  Description: Google Cloud Platform infrastructure provider

Provider: vSphere
  API Version: infrastructure.cluster.x-k8s.io/v1beta1
  Description: VMware vSphere infrastructure provider

Note: This list shows commonly available providers.
To see actually installed providers in your cluster, check the deployed controllers.
